    {
      "id": "349d15bdbf395b3da55e1faf5734c38b1dc3e3d704bce388fe7564f4b8f8e3ac",
      "text": "Streaming In 'Next Question Suggestions' With Vercel's AI SDK",
      "hash": "af874af72cfd37e15daa6c56a88c71d5ed48f4efd0a9cd00e9b1dfe8589faec4"
    },
    {
      "id": "fcd9037271a7081b80b7cc5f380dc49a8219fef8aaf93321e0461257afe6524e",
      "text": "Stream AI-powered next question suggestions with the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "e1d26f33f3c0c5bd65be2f5c5bb29a54cefd7017c77937d6c97cee31f012f288"
    },
    {
      "id": "ccfa5d0d3d62c7f2006426be10cb9307ba74f22ca440dfceefbd23f874dcab8e",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33d9d8f1c422860884a6b5e6a54743dbe1bbb188ae0c2b8e6204170a7f1e89a",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3f271b3149198dda0a912f94e9ca35397c4acb965a78ae8b02076fabf1b6a81",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "88993b9f72dcae7d840e13bf46cc13179591855c7e2247b0bf25cf256304fe05",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "18c7084792fe4685e4eeecbe24be632318e2e8e65d9b22c11dc7401427de4daa",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "8597b2220c41e12d056c048667cf5a47fa7bf5c0ea8d1155837bc78896e1ecac",
      "text": "High-Level Overview",
      "hash": "0b11350d9502e1cdeeed69a4bf0096a054b861db1f891ae8bed8e79c60e93ba8"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e0378a96d2cd63d28a98434ab9e24c37a2d3d7531c4286d979981cca6fdfffc",
      "text": "Streaming the Initial Response",
      "hash": "baba42da1e34cbee590b7512dd5a644c343497f80add590d89166d6e8d66ad5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "40f3fbb3134615fa3f6c92576ae1c9ef2154ba9dcf4167cd19de3a1937caa2e2",
      "text": "Generating Follow-Up Suggestions",
      "hash": "6d09643a1706d6febf7603625eb5ed0da3c9c8d73076dc3435429234587941f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "56278d133b5da9a3d4aafa73b4bd9ea97dbbaa25016d5acfd7bcd41f9926923c",
      "text": "Streaming Suggestions to the Frontend",
      "hash": "00d366581d6f47def76671faafe76d24602b0c5d4ca50221c89b394b6ef2f2df"
    },
    {
      "id": "94c72c7a160bb20698509041515d35c0b9a6aab322028261dacd3aecfb3d93a3",
      "text": "Type Safety for Custom Message Parts",
      "hash": "66cdde3ac46373cc971805e59d7f97aa3547cf6f2d2415959f38e44ce929ed6b"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2ff2884661a3e8e2f85c57c7c227719dbfc9610e71ade8beb0844a14febaeef",
      "text": "Frontend Implementation",
      "hash": "38deb6327cbf41dae598f40d678ae59a173a331034224a81c45d83f66f9e7fce"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca3ec1e7edd279976a067541e7d4f874a35a10fcb9993fc6d2bba06bac76b0df",
      "text": "Summary",
      "hash": "8e76a94ac8320d515375e625bef1829238b097ecbd33611b59eeefd4ffefebfb"
    },
    {
      "id": "0af020275b013fb9fe71c8243e4b0b4a4e562253192e86089a7d515da22b0308",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "47725fd2b3d9b6c062b3147835327b3e8f87b71314af5c63ea135a1b32369f33",
      "text": "One extremely common pattern for AI-powered apps is to provide suggested next questions for the user to ask. This lets users who are not familiar with these interfaces get started quickly.",
      "hash": "8ad18877d840d48991098a0eb82f32de5f1455d4e65a3294ab278d1c3ad16e10"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb4fc48e1231e4dd3a517589975a95ccae518f15c0a0c1f04c94550cfa706651",
      "text": "Let's look at a basic implementation where when we initiate a conversation, it suggests next questions that stream in as the user requests them.",
      "hash": "f26aaf5c40f13af16833860ed809219531988b1534ab1a96d1a08f4afa977c6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "8cd359843d83d5d00ba12b2955182d8120bbf10d73938de03bc1f273165e9ae7",
      "text": "The implementation involves a POST request to",
      "hash": "bb735e3510fb95c8dc6cb05dc80c78524bc09cb05cd9a9e62d8d8e64a60d3582"
    },
    {
      "id": "df73f1eb0a624ceec1afa25417566829940a4924fcf34a3fc4ac6a444d56fd86",
      "text": ", receiving UI messages from the body. These UI messages get converted into model messages before the main processing begins.",
      "hash": "060b84d9845c4edc4b028fe6b5e9d6a8f9e80af44546cadeaf8efdd257d88d64"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034beb87fe31d5bedcd71096ef434f88989470efe50bcc139c8154553b889b4",
      "text": "The flow consists of two streams combined into one parent stream:",
      "hash": "9a54379b61e82fe74e482605986fc64f893090696051d00e3b284bbf16012273"
    },
    {
      "id": "83e3c901536fa65d95734a430fc550bdc2bb8de747ce49cb958ee0dc9f1386b3",
      "text": "The first stream for our initial response",
      "hash": "a18dedf44be4eb55f36fa8b2b0490ae1ef301499593fb280463acd287f71ed2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc4d767f9db2543e491d5ffb35fab5d3c9a5d5d28b55c930c1e672cb5cc121a",
      "text": "The second stream for follow-up suggestions",
      "hash": "60f42a80fa6de4214f3f89791619cda2fe5aa4d842d20afc2172219f760c4e97"
    },
    {
      "id": "3333bad58500cb2889fa92b37f5cd927dda7708e044a0a6ae209e656f3341031",
      "text": "To compose these streams together, we create a parent stream with",
      "hash": "7df6710f6be65d7612c1ddcb466f6e6aba7794abf4f0ab3ae3e184884a486aad"
    },
    {
      "id": "f38528ba9de44693bb49578c6d8a196a790d57890829cc5a9ffe16754399b1a5",
      "text": ", which exposes a writer:",
      "hash": "9bd463e2d9beffe6d7f0460bd312b2a2e955509b9c2c9e63668483a36308bf16"
    },
    {
      "id": "46ae7bb07891e2ab806b1acbe38a8ac5bc850286cefadd7a16c6b2b8493fe713",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "35761f91ff2951e898e1e2a6606a00b73cc8a6747e4c356360660870c9e4bf34",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "aae12f8b3f54f2b680c7ab8dbf9187b087fe90f4c83409a938a1d336f2989f65",
      "text": "Here's how the initial response is streamed:",
      "hash": "8317236677f273e462a5e4950c56747c3772d28852a3c62b8dfbacde792e2583"
    },
    {
      "id": "206b287a50164110328b6fd0503e64f0b27b2f81842af760c7ab10d083a40983",
      "text": "This function calls",
      "hash": "88cbe29fb3d0274539c2eddf336b1d474afa3b2e28f0443091aeb9e4e50a846d"
    },
    {
      "id": "44f67470ea895dd6b03ccaa75c042f5e028c923e6e7bd7acf87673678f3fd092",
      "text": "using the Gemini 2.0 Flash model (though you could use any model with the AI SDK). The stream is merged into the UI message stream using",
      "hash": "b87b52940b0f69d50954a167db2ef9a5800dc6bd28d624cff22be0a17c278011"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c3b4fb4ae80635b089016789f2be956ffe22ec7cd9a886b6b4aec13bc3f47fa",
      "text": ", and we wait for the stream to complete with",
      "hash": "fa23c987db96037f4b881a257794f36a44132ad3f077f19ba31e2d6cea24756c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c053ad18539606b1745560d94cee3744070897082e0638db687fd111d10259ca",
      "text": "Finally, we return the messages produced by the call, which will be used in the next function.",
      "hash": "26cca669de5dc2e7dab212f13e76d9d85ad4a5e2c7e47b91c4180a813a8f1a6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "d988925cade7024d0a24f53a23c16804ce27cecd924ed7d751567a6131727965",
      "text": "After getting the initial response, we pass both the original messages and the response messages to",
      "hash": "4d99b26d3fc1cc5846b055e9f807a87d10fabb35f77119800a3849c539bf0e70"
    },
    {
      "id": "296cd371fb0e2d7f248bf5e90013f3a3527fd010fae12c15185d0f431d802f18",
      "text": "This function uses",
      "hash": "8498130911bacc2b7e77af62c2092f0ca80fc0c210d26e2d5a7071c5a5233ddc"
    },
    {
      "id": "22c8199dfe4526f000c858d60f1e2b60c3e69f0b9759b1e1189bf16f219220a6",
      "text": "with a Zod schema that defines an array of strings for suggestions. We could add a",
      "hash": "67a7c716f4047237d93d2ef5219da2ca1167a7fe72af82c015ca4b75f2ba3298"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad06a95cc6bbbe67953a58253f63be34a7cf7d458040b040e8fdf254c9315ae2",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "de2c45d5ef35f32c66ad6f449158b80806d7534854aa7cc3cb9db9a133af143c",
      "text": "and further context engineering here, but this simple approach works well enough.",
      "hash": "d2c443f8247d0124dfb910bf0b9bbb172486fb54535517d78a8a00392e20dfa1"
    },
    {
      "id": "f69d98542b71aaa0503ccd7b66bd390779b3b7933fc2a0ae4165ab12bfa567bd",
      "text": "The follow-up suggestions get piped into",
      "hash": "232b5e3deb11275ec0125a76bbe67f5f3f64b2215b84eadaf78b395da364222d"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd33518f027d1e747e8277c486fdaf0990244cd9a066591bc3cf521da8bbe6db",
      "text": "The suggestions are treated as a custom part of the message. We define the type of this message by specifying a",
      "hash": "db3b57a85b7e0f052be96da07870e17d712e4c6bd56365e9b329fe3b0e4cdadb"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e77b6648f307a1b493c13b68734c4ddd11c5333907fa451c5de0bbb1b7465a9",
      "text": ", passing",
      "hash": "1260ed790fd2ce26e7fa2f9ffec7b9e138041b184449014825c1b62b0324f988"
    },
    {
      "id": "51b3f18c746937ccd4e6955177841415bf173835b1021330bf452ff6e415f4d3",
      "text": "as the first parameter and",
      "hash": "1e08ad9da45c6541310fa53d92f47af526cd93f0770e06362add0cf27fe54684"
    },
    {
      "id": "8480fbcf87c47bfc508ab65413a159b85f6742bb5780aedad2c637eb0457c54d",
      "text": "as the second.",
      "hash": "c34112d59c7fed84c148b0ec12769dbecbcb2399eebed81b3c96f1c85c257225"
    },
    {
      "id": "e78819dc6edda209c4bf2fe78f4a46508effddf2f1608558d0736f7748578751",
      "text": "We declare our custom message type to ensure type safety:",
      "hash": "28a7613cc5d3033ec749f19d43f403e0e05309cd5d0564b10a7f774611035f07"
    },
    {
      "id": "439896add05eca0ad377b038c32dc081c068d208577337b87c20df7e4a4b3b17",
      "text": "This makes our code type-safe when writing to streams - we can only pass in a string array to the",
      "hash": "b2918ace438ecbd8ce6ac629a85281c0d10b1e4a295bb969bbe4dd541d0dcbbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "94525faa9db7e99f4163f69391c42c2bc85d2ca79ff0f78c7de86daf00c07a87",
      "text": "part.",
      "hash": "c80f6f433e603d1d0d67a412c4a2855a4fa18473536ac806ee534e5fa2810206"
    },
    {
      "id": "c664ccbd8c45696e0009926eac789971a0bf5500936c5592d2980406be5e628e",
      "text": "In the frontend, we use the",
      "hash": "6c3cb8f27f507975c4d9e9cd7af03e5350e95df57f747709caa259492f99e487"
    },
    {
      "id": "da46d692f93834f4c00be3632bc357272d4e914b09fc48ba8ffa0068652f458f",
      "text": "hook with our custom message type:",
      "hash": "e9d80adfc31894f9902141819780e50dbeba3a6867f31b1eb0b14993edf01bc3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5734004e0eb86e7f7a850241e4f70b4d740c48dc34b234a2c3096634f209cb",
      "text": "We extract the latest suggestions from the most recent message's parts. These might be undefined if we have no messages yet or if suggestions haven't started streaming.",
      "hash": "e1b006c9cf23e376f150446139f7a01aa5e27b5b52de0242e1a83b098c05ba0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "9af579dd1ba6fa1dc04c3a73c98228292b0694fd188073a39666ebc44a83c209",
      "text": "The suggestions are then rendered as buttons:",
      "hash": "38aba93298fc78130bfff3460619cba7447b52b9643833149661e366ac48b315"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb232b324f307e57e11f1ef08215564ddddfe412f4cc6a056ba98e2742b8b3c0",
      "text": "We also provide default suggestions if there are no messages yet. When a user clicks a suggestion button, it populates the input field.",
      "hash": "1014eb3c0c3fe4cd6164d7f07405f9c90dda8dc7965f2267ed51b8af62aa15e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "6fe0b3632a6cf604cb918815f5172641e8788548a551048fa68e997c55aba2f9",
      "text": "This pattern allows us to stream suggestions to the frontend in the same API endpoint as the rest of our content, creating a seamless experience for users. The suggestions update in real-time as they become available, helping users navigate the conversation more easily.",
      "hash": "a527fa74a6db0f188e9371ef4df42e9eb0b298be93d5f8770b9b488edce55bf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a2a0636d2a373371af9d4f288a77a56e67a36d8de64fb4a2e59d7153ea342ae",
      "text": "The key components are:",
      "hash": "6b3f02d3bb03d62ec74927d2e8aa2bf9dd83a725b8727dcfae560a1bebf15156"
    },
    {
      "id": "2310fb3c83f4f8aa4ef6e9472e3cb1125c4169356f581d1f3dbcbccef8d780ae",
      "text": "A unified stream combining initial response and suggestions",
      "hash": "2f66fef95bc0c0356eb5c7326b1ad3177588b1dd204238437fd1902c54ea16a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "93cd622540edc344a68de12e57eb7dd8d4c9e3e52ed9e97dba2842f54308f08f",
      "text": "Type-safe message parts for structured data",
      "hash": "073b078f000f2ad7692bb53218a0cfa4aebdbb008750d709eb88ccada792c815"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9ec1a60064c6652758e199dc066b73cf69c153f5ecce03ba596ad3572d3a2b9",
      "text": "Real-time streaming of suggestions to the frontend",
